# faff native-map set: unknown faff type 'banana' in mappings. Accepted: bug, feature, spike, chore, epic, default
# faff native-map set: template id 'same' is mapped to more than one faff type (one template maps to one type)
# faff native-map set: malformed payload (invalid JSON on stdin)
# faff: bad-enum: unknown faff type 'banana'. Accepted: bug, feature, spike, chore, epic, default
