# ok   identical lens-sets — no churn (churn)
# ok   identical lens-sets — no churn (new_lenses)
# ok   strict-subset shrink — no churn (churn)
# ok   strict-subset shrink — no churn (new_lenses)
# ok   a genuinely new lens appears alongside the old — churn (churn)
# ok   a genuinely new lens appears alongside the old — churn (new_lenses)
# ok   a fully disjoint lens-set swap — churn (churn)
# ok   a fully disjoint lens-set swap — churn (new_lenses)
# ok   missing prior round — degrades to no-churn, never crashes (churn)
# ok   missing prior round — degrades to no-churn, never crashes (new_lenses)
# ok   empty objections both rounds — no churn (e.g. two non-approve edge records) (churn)
# ok   empty objections both rounds — no churn (e.g. two non-approve edge records) (new_lenses)
# ok   lensSet tolerates non-array objections
# ok   lensSet tolerates a garbage entry
# ok   lensSet dedupes + sorts
# ok   roundNumberFromPath parses round-<n>.json
# ok   roundNumberFromPath returns null for a non-matching name
# ok   readRoundRecord reports missing (not malformed) for an absent file
